@EFinal_HostAddress = http://localhost:5237

### Obtener todos los vehiculos
GET {{EFinal_HostAddress}}/api/vehiculos
Accept: application/json

### Crear vehiculo
POST {{EFinal_HostAddress}}/api/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "P123ABC",
  "marca": "Toyota",
  "modelo": "Corolla",
  "anio": 2020,
  "color": "Blanco",
  "estado": true
}

### Actualizar vehiculo
PATCH {{EFinal_HostAddress}}/api/vehiculos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placa": "P123ABC",
  "marca": "Toyota",
  "modelo": "Corolla",
  "anio": 2021,
  "color": "Negro",
  "estado": false
}

### Eliminar vehiculo
DELETE {{EFinal_HostAddress}}/api/vehiculos/1
